                <note rend="inline" type="source">723.2515/827: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Sterling</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-01-27T15:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 27,
                                1922—3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>8. Arrangement stated in your 2 January 27 noon will be satisfactory to the
                    Department. Telegraph when new note received.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
